# REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP Client collection
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@eventId = REPLACE_WITH_EVENT_ID
@orderId = REPLACE_WITH_ORDER_ID

### Create event
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rock Fest",
  "date": "2027-05-20T20:00:00Z",
  "venue": "Movistar Arena",
  "totalCapacity": 100
}

### List events
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events

### Get event
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events/{{eventId}}

### Real-time availability
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events/{{eventId}}/availability

### Place order (async, returns 202)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}

{
  "eventId": "{{eventId}}",
  "customerId": "customer-1",
  "quantity": 2
}

### Get order status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}

### Confirm order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/confirm

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
